# Vendored from Claude-of-Duty (MIT) — procedural audio (footsteps)

Source: https://github.com/mshumer/Claude-of-Duty (Matt Shumer), MIT.

Minimal set for surface-keyed procedural footsteps (pure Web Audio, zero assets,
three-free, no ctx): rng.js (seedable PRNG), dsp.js (NoiseBank + synth primitives).
Used in this repo for synthesized drum components.
